Request divisor task. It asserts div_valid_i at negedge, waits for ready_rise_count to increase, records ready_time, wait_cycles, then deasserts at negedge. It should also check H2 by holding div_i stable. We'll just do it.
```systemverilog
  task automatic request_div(input logic [3:0] nd, output int wait_cycles, output bit ok, output time ready_time);
    int start_ready_count;
    int cnt;
    @(negedge clk_i);
    div_i = nd;
    div_valid_i = 1'b1;
